  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening NEPA through GCF Readiness and Preparatory Support Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i.	establishing the institutional arrangements required to manage the country?s engagements with the GCF and ensure the country can take the lead in shaping its pipeline of GCF projects; and
